                                                "sense_id": "bb71b574-df07-3af3-84ab-02e306611ebe",
                                                "text": "I mind him well as he sat in his chair or daundered through Caulds, a kind word for every one and sage counsel in time of distress, but withal a severe man to himself and a crucifier of the body."
                                            }
                                        ]
